        "original_id": "fe4c14b0-65b7-50e7-96e0-955fc3bf1746",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sia, Nigel Corsbie, Sergei Prokofiev, Sergei O. Prokofieff, Oleg Prokofiev, Lina Prokofiev, Sofia Korovina\n- Works: Taken for Granted, Montagues and Capulets, Party Like a Russian\n\nFacts:\n- Sergei Prokofiev was a Russian composer who wrote the classical music work \"Montagues and Capulets.\"\n- Sergei O. Prokofieff was the grandson of composer Sergei Prokofiev and his first wife Lina Prokofiev.\n- Sergei O. Prokofieff was the son of Oleg Prokofiev and his first wife Sofia Korovina.\n- The song \"Taken for Granted\" was written by Sia and produced by Nigel Corsbie.\n- The song \"Taken for Granted\" heavily samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets.\"\n- The chorus of the song \"Party Like a Russian\" samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets.\"",
